      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S ARYA (4) goes very well over this trip including two wins. In the money last time at Q Parklands (30.58) in a Grade 5, finishing a 5.5 lengths third. Looks well placed and should feature. UNIQUE REWARD (1) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish second, beaten 2.5 lengths (30.31) at Q Parklands in a Grade 5 over 520m. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Overdue and expected to feature again. GEORGIA SKIES (2) was among the minors three back at Q Parklands then missed the frame the last two, but drawn box 2 this time where she has won before. Can turn it around this time. CANYA FAKE IT (7) scored by half a length last time (22.08) in a Grade 6 over 390m at this track. Has already won out of this draw.",
